/T (A. Working Dataset The dataset used torunand validate this pipeline contains 391 labeled email recordswith five fields: id \(unique identifier\), subject \(email subjectline\), body \(email body text\), email_text \(subject and body combined, used for NLP processing\), and label \(target class: phishing or legitimate\). The class distribution is 229 phishing emails \(58.6%\) and 162 legitimate emails \(41.4%\), a reasonably balanced split for training, shown in Fig. 1. )
/E (A. Working Dataset The dataset used torunand validate this pipeline contains 391 labeled email recordswith five fields: id \(unique identifier\), subject \(email subjectline\), body \(email body text\), email_text \(subject and body combined, used for NLP processing\), and label \(target class: phishing or legitimate\). The class distribution is 229 phishing emails \(58.6%\) and 162 legitimate emails \(41.4%\), a reasonably balanced split for training, shown in Fig. 1. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
