/T (B. Real-World Dataset Sources To scale the system beyondtheworking dataset, the following public, real-world phishingemaildatasets can be merged in by mapping their text and labelcolumns to email_text and label: the combined Enron/Ling/CEAS/Nazario/Nigerian- Fraud/SpamAssassin corpusonKaggle [3]; the Subhajournal phishing emails dataset on Kaggle[4]; the ealvaradob/phishing- dataset on Hugging Face [5];theNazario Phishing Corpus [6]; and the SpamAssassin PublicCorpus [7]. These sources vary considerably in size, rangingfrom a few thousand to over 250,000 labeled messages, andinlabel quality, so any merged corpus should be re-audited forduplicate or mislabeled entries before retraining. )
/E (B. Real-World Dataset Sources To scale the system beyondtheworking dataset, the following public, real-world phishingemaildatasets can be merged in by mapping their text and labelcolumns to email_text and label: the combined Enron/Ling/CEAS/Nazario/Nigerian- Fraud/SpamAssassin corpusonKaggle [3]; the Subhajournal phishing emails dataset on Kaggle[4]; the ealvaradob/phishing- dataset on Hugging Face [5];theNazario Phishing Corpus [6]; and the SpamAssassin PublicCorpus [7]. These sources vary considerably in size, rangingfrom a few thousand to over 250,000 labeled messages, andinlabel quality, so any merged corpus should be re-audited forduplicate or mislabeled entries before retraining. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
