/T (The prototype allows a user to paste any email text and instantly receive a phishing-probability score, a plain-language verdict, and a breakdown of the words that most influenced the decision. All inference runs client-side in the browser, so no email content is transmitted to any server, which is a meaningful privacy advantage over a server-hosted alternative and removes network latency from the prediction loop. )
