/Title (The primarythreattotheexternal validity of the reported results is datasetrealism:becausethe working corpus was generated from asmallnumberoftemplates, the perfect scores in Table I measurethepipeline'sability to separate two clearly templated writingstylesratherthanits ability to detect novel phishing campaignsinthewild.Asecondary threat is label noise, which is minimalherebyconstruction but is a known issue in publicly scrapedphishingcorporaand should be audited for when SectionIV-Bsourcesaremerged in. These threats do not affect the internalvalidityofthepipeline implementation itself, which was verifiedindependentlyin Section VII by cross-checking the JavaScriptre-implementation against the original scikit-learn model.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 362 0 R
>>
endobj
